    Add validation for tenant production authentication options
    
    - Implemented `ValidateTenantProductionAuthenticationOptions` to ensure proper configuration of OIDC authentication in production environments.
    - Added unit tests for various scenarios including validation failures for missing or incorrect settings in production.
    - Ensured that environment variables can override app settings for flexible configuration.

